OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fspreading north through the evening
OL,8,Fand night, turning heavy at times.
OL,9,FSome drier spells developing later in
OL,10,Fthe night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy in the morning with
OL,13,Fsome rain or drizzle. Some showers
OL,14,Fbreaking out in the afternoon,
OL,15,Foccasionally heavy and perhaps
OL,16,Fthundery, but also some bright spells
OL,17,Fbreaking through at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
