OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBreezy
OL,6,Fand cloudy with showers or longer
OL,7,Fspells of rain on Wednesday. Drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter with just a few showers on
OL,9,FThursday. Showery rain from the west
OL,10,Fon Friday.
